241
00:16:50,060 --> 00:16:56,060
Hey, Valtos! Make me a portal!

242
00:16:57,060 --> 00:17:02,060
Man, they're such jerks!

243
00:17:03,060 --> 00:17:04,060
Everyone!

244
00:17:05,060 --> 00:17:10,060
You should get away from me!

245
00:17:10,060 --> 00:17:11,060
Henry!

246
00:17:12,060 --> 00:17:13,060
Henry!

247
00:17:14,060 --> 00:17:16,060
He got too far away from the raging Black Bull!

248
00:17:16,060 --> 00:17:19,060
And without Charmy, nobody can recharge their mana if it runs out!

249
00:17:20,060 --> 00:17:21,060
You guys!

250
00:17:25,060 --> 00:17:27,060
My armor! It vanished!

251
00:17:28,060 --> 00:17:31,060
Well, that crazy spell of yours was kind of a doozy.

252
00:17:32,060 --> 00:17:34,060
Your body probably can't keep up with it just yet.

253
00:17:34,060 --> 00:17:38,060
Now that I think of it, I'm running pretty low on juice myself.

254
00:17:39,060 --> 00:17:40,060
Oh, Oster!

255
00:17:41,060 --> 00:17:43,060
Goodness, you look even more feeble than usual!

256
00:17:43,060 --> 00:17:47,060
I know the Black Bulls need my help, but I can't let the boss man slip through my fingers.

257
00:17:48,060 --> 00:17:50,060
Don't screw this up, you hear me?!

258
00:17:51,060 --> 00:17:53,060
I want you to surpass your damn limits!

259
00:17:54,060 --> 00:17:55,060
Oh my God, that's good!

260
00:17:56,060 --> 00:17:58,060
Sounds good! I'll see you in a little bit then!

261
00:17:59,060 --> 00:18:00,060
Time to go, Jack!

262
00:18:01,060 --> 00:18:03,060
Sis, when am I taking orders from you?!

263
00:18:04,060 --> 00:18:06,060
Look, brother. Some of them are gone.

264
00:18:07,060 --> 00:18:11,060
Then we need to kill the rest of them quickly and hurry after the ones who left.

265
00:18:12,060 --> 00:18:16,060
That's where you come in, Eklat. It's time for a fun game of hide-and-seek.

266
00:18:17,060 --> 00:18:18,060
Right.

267
00:18:19,060 --> 00:18:20,060
Willpower won't be enough to save them now.

268
00:18:20,060 --> 00:18:30,060
I found them.

269
00:18:31,060 --> 00:18:33,060
Look at me, humans.

270
00:18:36,060 --> 00:18:37,060
Mirror magic!

271
00:18:38,060 --> 00:18:39,060
Eye magic!

272
00:18:40,060 --> 00:18:41,060
Combo spell reflect iris!

273
00:18:41,060 --> 00:18:47,060
What's happening?!

274
00:18:48,060 --> 00:18:49,060
Why can't I move?

275
00:18:50,060 --> 00:18:51,060
We're stuck!

276
00:18:52,060 --> 00:18:53,060
How is this possible?!

277
00:18:54,060 --> 00:18:55,060
My magic!

278
00:18:58,060 --> 00:19:01,060
Little Eklat has the ability to immobilize anybody who looks into her eyes.

279
00:19:02,060 --> 00:19:04,060
It renders your magic useless as well.

280
00:19:05,060 --> 00:19:06,060
What?!

281
00:19:07,060 --> 00:19:09,060
But Marie doesn't even have her grimoire yet!

282
00:19:10,060 --> 00:19:12,060
I guess the elves are just that powerful.

283
00:19:13,060 --> 00:19:14,060
There's no hope for you.

284
00:19:15,060 --> 00:19:16,060
Now die, helpless worms.

285
00:19:18,060 --> 00:19:19,060
Not yet.

286
00:19:20,060 --> 00:19:21,060
I refuse to give up!

287
00:19:25,060 --> 00:19:27,060
This is not the end!

288
00:19:27,060 --> 00:19:30,060
I still have to turn Goshen Marie back to normal!

289
00:19:31,060 --> 00:19:32,060
Not to mention everyone else!

290
00:19:33,060 --> 00:19:34,060
I'll set things right!

291
00:19:35,060 --> 00:19:36,060
No matter what it takes!

292
00:19:36,060 --> 00:19:38,060
AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAH!

293
00:19:41,060 --> 00:19:42,060
AAAAAAAAAAAAAH!

294
00:19:45,060 --> 00:19:46,060
Hey, look at that!

295
00:19:47,060 --> 00:19:48,060
I can move!

296
00:19:49,060 --> 00:19:50,060
He must have nullified the spell.

297
00:19:52,060 --> 00:19:54,060
Asta, you did it!

298
00:19:54,060 --> 00:19:56,060
Okay, you guys.

299
00:19:57,060 --> 00:19:58,060
Everyone ready?!

300
00:19:59,060 --> 00:20:00,060
Hold on.

301
00:20:01,060 --> 00:20:02,060
That blade.

302
00:20:03,060 --> 00:20:05,060
Why does he have Lick's demon destroyer sword?

303
00:20:06,060 --> 00:20:07,060
You don't deserve that weapon!

304
00:20:08,060 --> 00:20:09,060
Give it back and die!

305
00:20:13,060 --> 00:20:14,060
I'll use transformation magic!

306
00:20:15,060 --> 00:20:16,060
Here!

307
00:20:17,060 --> 00:20:18,060
To make more mirrors!

308
00:20:19,060 --> 00:20:20,060
Poison magic!

309
00:20:20,060 --> 00:20:21,060
Forbidden fruit!

310
00:20:21,060 --> 00:20:36,060
It may be stronger now, but I still understand Goshen's magic really well.

311
00:20:37,060 --> 00:20:39,060
Actually, he kinda ticks me off.

312
00:20:40,060 --> 00:20:43,060
The way he used to shoot those weird beams at me.

313
00:20:44,060 --> 00:20:46,060
You know, getting possessed didn't change his personality much.

314
00:20:46,060 --> 00:20:47,060
Yes, I agree.

315
00:20:48,060 --> 00:20:51,060
And after we save him, he'll go right back to insulting us.

316
00:20:52,060 --> 00:20:53,060
That's exactly what'll happen!

317
00:20:53,060 --> 00:20:58,060
Plus, he'll keep showing us pictures of his sister and making dolls of her and getting nosebleeds when he thinks about her!

318
00:20:58,060 --> 00:21:00,060
He's really not a fun person to be around!

319
00:21:01,060 --> 00:21:04,060
He's always been creepy!

320
00:21:04,060 --> 00:21:10,060
That's why we need to bring back the ghost we all know!

321
00:21:11,060 --> 00:21:13,060
So we can complain to his face!

322
00:21:13,060 --> 00:21:16,060
She's always been richer and being bisexual!

323
00:21:17,060 --> 00:21:22,060
She died during all of poker,

324
00:21:22,060 --> 00:21:33,880
She'sston-

325
00:21:33,880 --> 00:22:03,860
Thank you.

326
00:22:03,880 --> 00:22:33,860
Thank you.

327
00:22:33,880 --> 00:23:03,860
To be continued...

328
00:23:03,880 --> 00:23:06,940
I was in a bit of a rush to take you out.

329
00:23:07,340 --> 00:23:09,820
Which means your bodies are going to be pretty puny now.

330
00:23:12,620 --> 00:23:15,080
Okay, I probably shouldn't have jumped the gun.

331
00:23:16,820 --> 00:23:17,520
Part 2.

332
00:23:19,660 --> 00:23:22,900
I had plenty of time to spare, so I let him steep.

333
00:23:23,720 --> 00:23:26,420
Veto and Fauna should be more mature this time around.

334
00:23:28,440 --> 00:23:30,480
I don't know what happened to me before.

335
00:23:30,480 --> 00:23:33,260
We gotta find some kind of happy medium here.

336
00:23:33,880 --> 00:23:37,620
My best friend, Ghosh Adlai.

337
00:23:38,120 --> 00:23:40,180
Your little sister is basically my little sister.

338
00:23:40,780 --> 00:23:43,060
That's right, Marie is my actual sister.

339
00:23:43,760 --> 00:23:45,120
Black Clover, page 111.

340
00:23:45,520 --> 00:23:46,540
The eyes in the mirror.

341
00:23:47,360 --> 00:23:49,560
Ah, dear sister, I weep for you.

